                      "kind": "control",
                      "statement": "The decisive target-document authorization control is validate_document: it returns the document only when both global and owner-aware object access checks succeed, and otherwise raises PermissionDenied.",
                      "citations": [
                        {
                          "sourceId": "src-d74dd1895d260a60",
